<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>SFINCS Launcher - Manual Mode</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f6f7fb;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --panel-2: #f0f3f8;
      --panel-3: #e7eef8;
      --text: #172033;
      --muted: #667085;
      --line: #d9dee8;
      --accent: #315f9f;
      --accent-2: #173f73;
      --good: #18794e;
      --warn: #b25e09;
      --bad: #b42318;
      --radius: 18px;
      --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24, 39, 75, 0.08);
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      --sans: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #102a4f, #315f9f);
      color: white;
      padding: 24px clamp(18px, 4vw, 54px);
    }

    .header-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 { margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3vw, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.35rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }


    .runner-output {
      background: #101828;
      color: #d0d5dd;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      max-height: 620px;
      overflow: auto;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .submit-review-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .submit-review-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .submit-review-row strong {
      color: #263248;
    }

    .button-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      max-width: 900px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .status-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 14px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .status-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      padding: 7px 0;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .status-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .status-row span:first-child { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); }
    .status-row span:last-child { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); }

    main {
      max-width: 1500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 22px clamp(18px, 4vw, 54px) 54px;
    }

    a { color: inherit; }

    .top-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .left-actions, .right-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .back-link, button, .file-label {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(24, 39, 75, 0.06);
    }

    button.primary, .file-label.primary {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      background: var(--accent);
      color: white;
    }

    button.secondary { background: var(--panel-2); }
    button.danger { background: #ffeceb; color: var(--bad); border-color: #ffbdb8; }
    button:disabled, .disabled-button {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    input[type="file"] { display: none; }

    .layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 420px;
      gap: 22px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .panel {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .panel + .panel { margin-top: 18px; }

    .tab-strip-wrap {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      background: rgba(246, 247, 251, 0.94);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 8px 0 2px;
      margin: -8px 0 8px;
    }
    
    .tab-strip {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 0;
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }

    .tab {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      color: #344054;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      font-weight: 850;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(24, 39, 75, 0.04);
    }

    .tab.active {
      background: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: white;
    }

    .tab.check-tab.active { background: var(--warn); border-color: var(--warn); }
    .tab.submit-tab.active { background: var(--bad); border-color: var(--bad); }

    .tab-panel { display: none; }
    .tab-panel.active { display: block; }

    .section-intro {
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      max-width: 920px;
    }

    .config-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: separate;
      border-spacing: 0;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: white;
    }

    .config-table th, .config-table td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      vertical-align: top;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .config-table th {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: #344054;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    }

    .config-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
    .config-table td:first-child { width: 250px; font-weight: 850; color: #263248; }
    .config-table td:nth-child(2) { width: 42%; }
    .config-table td:last-child { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 9px 11px;
      background: white;
      color: var(--text);
      font: inherit;
    }

    textarea {
      min-height: 90px;
      resize: vertical;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.84rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .short-textarea { min-height: 58px; }
    .medium-textarea { min-height: 180px; }
    .long-page-textarea {
      min-height: 980px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .path-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .tiny-button {
      padding: 9px 10px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      box-shadow: none;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .field-note {
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }

    .pill-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: 12px 0 16px;
    }

    .pill {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .pill.good { color: var(--good); background: #eaf6ef; border-color: #badfca; }
    .pill.warn { color: var(--warn); background: #fff4e5; border-color: #ffd6a7; }
    .pill.bad { color: var(--bad); background: #ffeceb; border-color: #ffbdb8; }

    .side-panel {
      position: sticky;
      top: 18px;
    }

    .config-preview {
      background: #101828;
      color: #d0d5dd;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      max-height: 580px;
      overflow: auto;
    }

    .path-preview {
      font-family: var(--mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 10px;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .callout {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
      background: #edf4ff;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #27476f;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .callout.warn {
      border-left-color: var(--warn);
      background: #fff7ed;
      color: #7a3e00;
    }

    .callout.bad {
      border-left-color: var(--bad);
      background: #ffeceb;
      color: #7a1f18;
    }

    .checks-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .check-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
    }

    .check-item.good { border-color: #badfca; background: #f0fbf4; }
    .check-item.warn { border-color: #ffd6a7; background: #fff8ec; }
    .check-item.bad { border-color: #ffbdb8; background: #fff0ef; }
    .check-status { font-weight: 900; }
    .check-item.good .check-status { color: var(--good); }
    .check-item.warn .check-status { color: var(--warn); }
    .check-item.bad .check-status { color: var(--bad); }

    .submit-placeholder {
      min-height: 360px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 30px;
    }
    
        .help-button {
      position: fixed;
      left: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-decoration: none;
      z-index: 50;
    }

    .help-button:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .mono { font-family: var(--mono); }
    .muted { color: var(--muted); }

    @media (max-width: 1180px) {
      .header-grid, .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .side-panel { position: static; }
      .config-table td:first-child, .config-table td:nth-child(2) { width: auto; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 780px) {
      .config-table, .config-table thead, .config-table tbody, .config-table tr, .config-table th, .config-table td { display: block; }
      .config-table thead { display: none; }
      .config-table td { border-bottom: 0; }
      .config-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .config-table tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
      .path-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>



<!-- BEGIN permanent tab scrollbar patch -->
<style>
  html {
    scrollbar-gutter: stable both-edges;
    overflow-y: scroll;
  }

  body {
    overflow-y: scroll;
  }

  html,
  body,
  main,
  .config-preview,
  .runner-output,
  .path-preview,
  textarea,
  pre {
    scrollbar-width: auto !important;
    scrollbar-color: #6b7280 #d1d5db !important;
  }

  html::-webkit-scrollbar,
  body::-webkit-scrollbar,
  main::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .config-preview::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .runner-output::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .path-preview::-webkit-scrollbar,
  textarea::-webkit-scrollbar,
  pre::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 28px !important;
    height: 28px !important;
  }

  html::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  body::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  main::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  .config-preview::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  .runner-output::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  .path-preview::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  textarea::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  pre::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: #d1d5db !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
  }

  html::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  main::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  .config-preview::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  .runner-output::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  .path-preview::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  textarea::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  pre::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: #6b7280 !important;
    border: 5px solid #d1d5db !important;
    border-radius: 999px !important;
  }

  .tab-strip-wrap,
  .step-strip-wrap,
  .manual-tab-strip-wrap {
    padding-top: 8px !important;
    padding-bottom: 0 !important;
    margin-top: -8px !important;
    margin-bottom: 4px !important;
  }

  .manual-tab-strip-wrap {
    top: 54px !important;
  }

  .tab-strip,
  .step-strip,
  .manual-tab-strip {
    overflow-x: auto !important;
    overflow-y: hidden !important;
    padding-bottom: 0 !important;
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
    scrollbar-width: none !important;
  }

  .tab-strip::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .step-strip::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .manual-tab-strip::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none !important;
    width: 0 !important;
    height: 0 !important;
  }

  .permanent-tab-scrollbar {
    position: relative;
    height: 30px;
    margin: 4px 0 0px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #d1d5db;
    border: 1px solid #c4cad3;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.12);
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    touch-action: none;
  }

  .permanent-tab-scrollbar[hidden] {
    display: none !important;
  }

  .permanent-tab-scrollbar-thumb {
    position: absolute;
    top: 3px;
    bottom: 3px;
    left: 0;
    min-width: 80px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #6b7280;
    border: 1px solid #596170;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.24);
    cursor: grab;
  }

  .permanent-tab-scrollbar-thumb:active {
    cursor: grabbing;
  }
</style>
<!-- END permanent tab scrollbar patch -->

</head>
<body>
  <input type="hidden" data-key="pipeline_mode" data-type="string" value="preflight_only">
  <input type="hidden" data-key="preprocess_mode" data-type="string" value="hydromt_build">
  <input type="hidden" data-key="data_root" data-type="string" value="/proj/zefflab/projects/Flooding/Data/harris_county">
  <input type="hidden" data-key="sfincs_container" data-type="string" value="/proj/zefflab/projects/Flooding/pipeline/containers/sfincs-v2.3.0-mt-Faber-Release.sif">
  <header>
    <div class="header-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Manual Mode</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Direct control over a standard SFINCS pipeline JSON config. Fill the tables in any order, save a normal backend config, load an existing config, and use the check tab before moving to backend preflight/build/submit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-box" aria-label="Manual mode summary">
        <div class="status-row"><span>Config format</span><span>normal JSON</span></div>
        <div class="status-row"><span>Maintainer</span><span>Reichen Schaller</span></div>
        <div class="status-row"><span>Version</span><span>v1.1 (6/1/26)</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="top-actions">
      <div class="left-actions">
        <a class="back-link" href="index.html">← Back to main menu</a>
        <button class="secondary" type="button" id="check-button">Run page checks</button>
      </div>
      <div class="right-actions">
        <button class="secondary" type="button" data-new-run-button>
          New run / wipe page
        </button>
        <button class="primary" type="button" id="save-config-button">Save progress</button>
        <label class="file-label" for="load-config-input">Load config</label>
        <input id="load-config-input" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="layout">
      <section>
        <div class="tab-strip-wrap">
          <nav class="tab-strip" aria-label="Manual configuration tables">
            <button class="tab active" data-tab="tab-0" type="button">0 Run identity</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-1" type="button">1 Pipeline</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-2" type="button">2 Slurm general</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-3" type="button">3 Stage resources</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-4" type="button">4 Data catalogs</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-5" type="button">5 Required inputs</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-6" type="button">6 Optional inputs</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-7" type="button">7 Model settings</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-8" type="button">8 Elevation/mask</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-9" type="button">9 Roughness</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-10" type="button">10 Subgrid</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-11" type="button">11 Forcing</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-12" type="button">12 Infiltration</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-13" type="button">13 Output</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-14" type="button">14 Advanced</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-15" type="button">15 Postprocess</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-16" type="button">16 Safety/debug</button>
            <button class="tab" data-tab="tab-17" type="button">17 Backend paths</button>
            <button class="tab check-tab" data-tab="tab-check" type="button">Check all</button>
            <button class="tab submit-tab" data-tab="tab-submit" type="button">Submit</button>
          </nav>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB 0: RUN IDENTITY START -->
        <div class="panel tab-panel active" id="tab-0">
          <h2>0. Run identity / output locations</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">These settings define the run name, the output root, and the metadata that will be saved into the same JSON config used by the backend runner.</p>
          <table class="config-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Value</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>event_name</td><td><input data-key="event_name" data-type="string" value="harvey_2017"></td><td>Convenience label. If edited, run_name updates to event_name + run_series.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>run_series</td><td><input data-key="run_series" data-type="string" value="manual_001"></td><td>Convenience label for repeat experiments. If edited, run_name updates to event_name + run_series.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>run_name</td><td><input data-key="run_name" data-type="string" value="harvey_2017_manual_001"></td><td>If left untouched, this is event_name + run_series. If you edit run_name directly, it becomes the full run folder name until event_name or run_series is edited again.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>project_root</td><td><input data-key="project_root" data-type="string" value="/proj/zefflab/projects/Flooding/pipeline"></td><td>Backend pipeline bundle root.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>output_root</td><td><input data-key="output_root" data-type="string" value="/proj/zefflab/projects/Flooding/sfincs_runs"></td><td>Run folders will be created under this path by the backend.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>planned run root</td><td><div id="run-root-preview" class="path-preview"></div></td><td>Preview only. This is computed as output_root / run_name.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>overwrite_existing_run</td><td><select data-key="overwrite_existing_run" data-type="bool"><option value="false" selected>false</option><option value="true">true</option></select></td><td>Keep false unless you are deliberately replacing a run folder.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>allow_writes_inside_proj</td><td><select data-key="allow_writes_inside_proj" data-type="bool"><option value="true" selected>true</option><option value="false">false</option></select></td><td>Shared project runs use /proj. Personal scratch runs may keep this false.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>allow_missing_model_inputs</td><td><select data-key="allow_missing_model_inputs" data-type="bool"><option value="false" selected>false</option><option value="true">true</option></select></td><td>Real runs should normally keep this false. Skeleton tests may set it true.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>run_description</td><td><input data-key="run_description" data-type="string" value="Manual launcher SFINCS pipeline run."></td><td>Short human description.</td></tr>
              <tr><td>run_tags</td><td><textarea class="short-textarea" data-key="run_tags" data-type="json">["manual", "sfincs", "harris_county"]</textarea></td><td>JSON list of tags.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <!-- TAB 0: RUN IDENTITY END -->

        <!-- TAB 1: PIPELINE CONTROL START -->
        <div class="panel tab-panel" id="tab-1">
          <h2>1. Pipeline control</h2>
          <p class="section-intro">Controls which stages are intended to run and which preprocessing strategy is being configured. Manual mode is kept clean; already-processed native-file routing belongs in Override Mode.</p>
          <table class="config-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Value</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>run_preprocessing_job</td><td><select data-key="run_preprocessing_job" data-type="bool"><option value="true" selected>true</option><option value="false">false</option></select></td><td>Stage 1.</td></tr>
